'''Taste of Hate''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Sapphire Flask}}. 

==Modifiers==
Taste of Hate causes some of the incoming fire and lightning damage to be [[Damage taken as|taken as]] cold damage. This effect only applies to [[hit]]s and will not modify incoming [[damage over time]]. It is not the same mechanic as [[damage conversion]]. 

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 5.50 seconds instead.

==Legacy variants==
Taste of Hate has [[legacy variant]]s.

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.25.0|
* {{c|mod|(10-15)% of Physical Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage during Effect}}
* Gain (10-15)% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage during effect
* 30% chance to Avoid being Chilled during Effect
* 30% chance to Avoid being Frozen during Effect}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.15.0|
* {{C|mod|20% of Physical Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage during Flask effect}}
* {{C|mod|Gain (15-20)% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage during effect}}
* 30% chance to Avoid being Chilled during Flask effect
* 30% chance to Avoid being Frozen during Flask effect}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.0.0|
* {{C|mod|20% of Physical Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage during Flask effect}}
* {{c|mod|Gain (20-30)% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage during effect}}
* 30% chance to Avoid being Chilled during Flask effect
* 30% chance to Avoid being Frozen during Flask effect}}
{{legacy variant table row|2.2.0|
* {{C|mod|30% of Physical Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage during Flask effect}}
* {{c|mod|Gain 30% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage during effect}}
* 30% chance to Avoid being Chilled during Flask effect
* 30% chance to Avoid being Frozen during Flask effect}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

==Alternate artwork==
{|
| [[File:Taste of Hate race season 10 inventory icon.png|78px]] || [[Race season 10]] prize for reaching 1000 RP.

Using the <kbd>/convertracereward</kbd> [[chat command]], this item can be transformed into a flask skin, {{il|Alternate Art Taste of Hate}}. Be aware that the skin cannot be traded to other players or turned back into the original item.

|-
| [[File:Taste of Hate Relic inventory icon.png|78px]] || Rainbow [[Foil]] from [[Ancient Reliquary]] ({{il|Ancient Reliquary Key}} is a [[Legacy league]]s-limited drop)
|}

Both versions have legacy mods listed in [[#Legacy variants]].


It is also available in [[Voidborn Reliquary]] (as Voidborn foil colors), as well as [[Valdo's Map]]s (in Celestial foil colors).

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.1|
* Fixed a bug with the Taste of Hate Unique Flask where its Chill and Freeze Avoidance, and Physical as Added Cold Damage effects were not applying.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* The Taste of Hate Unique Flask no longer has 10-15% of Physical Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage during Effect. Instead, it now has 20-30% of Fire and Lightning Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage during Effect.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
* Alternate-art Unique Items can now be converted to account-bound microtransactions using the new <kbd>/convertracereward</kbd> chat command. The item will be destroyed, and you will be granted an account-bound microtransaction that changes the appearance of an item of the same type to match that of the destroyed item.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.15.0|
* Now has '10-15% of Physical Damage from Hits taken as Cold Damage' (previously 20%), and 'Gain 10-15% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage during effect' (previously 15-20%). Existing versions can be updated to the new values with a {{il|Divine Orb}}.
* The basetype, {{il|Sapphire Flask}}, now last 5 seconds (previously 4). They now consume 20 of 50 Charges on use (previously 30 of 60).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.9.0|
* Artwork changed. {{Undocumented}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.5.0|
* The basetype, {{il|Sapphire Flask}}, no longer grant added maximum resistances. Instead, reduce the damage taken of cold damage by 20%.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.0.0|
* Physical Damage added as extra Cold Damage lowered to 15-20%.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Taste of Hate now only makes you take 20% of physical damage as cold damage. It now adds 20-30% of physical as cold, rather than always 30%.
}}
{{Version history table row|1.3.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

